   scoringNote:'Each item states how many responses to select. Scoring is criterion-referenced and scaled from 100 to 1,000, so a raw percentage is not the same as the 720 you need, and Anthropic does not publish the conversion. Treat the scores in this app as a guide rather than a prediction.',
   aboutExam:'The Claude Certified Architect - Professional (CCAR-P) certification validates that you can design, build and deliver production-grade AI solutions on Anthropic\'s Claude platform. It targets practitioners in an architect role: selecting models, architectures and API patterns, applying prompt and context engineering, integrating Claude into enterprise systems, and building evaluation, security, compliance and governance into the design.',
   tips:[['💡',"The real exam uses scaled scoring - a raw percentage is not the same as the 720 pass mark"],['💡',"Target 80%+ overall and 75%+ in every domain for a confident pass"],['💡',"In this app, a multiple-response item scores only when you pick every correct option and nothing else"],['💡',"Study the Anthropic documentation linked in each answer"]]
